skills.summaryEn:
Analyze and troubleshoot Alibaba Cloud AnalyticDB (ADB) Spark applications—covering execution monitoring, failure diagnosis, performance anomaly detection, and cross-application comparison.
Use this skill when users need to:
1. Check the execution status of AnalyticDB Spark applications (e.g., running, succeeded, failed);
2. Analyze root causes of failed AnalyticDB Spark applications (e.g., OOM, data skew, dependency errors, permission issues);
3. Identify Spark applications with abnormally long execution durations via statistical analysis;
4. Compare similar Spark applications to pinpoint performance anomalies or detect differences in SQL execution plans.
